# 统一换行符：文本文件入库时统一为 LF，检出时按平台配置
* text=auto

# 明确的文本类型
*.cs text diff=csharp
*.xaml text
*.csproj text
*.sln text
*.json text
*.md text
*.ps1 text
*.iss text
*.yml text
*.yaml text

# 二进制文件，不做换行/合并处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pdf binary
*.snk binary
